WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.482
Welcome to Money Management and Budget.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.710
Money comes in.

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:11.830
That's your income, whatever it
looks like for you this month.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.567
Then money goes out,
in a lot of directions.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.990
Some of these you have to pay.
Others you get to choose.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.148
Needs keep you housed, fed,
connected, and able to get to work.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.880
Wants are the extras
that make life better.

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:39.843
Streaming, dining out, games, new shoes.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.550
A budget gives every dollar a job.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:47.183
Needs first, then wants,
then savings, even if it's a little.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:53.350
Here's one to think about.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.747
What is one want you
could trade for savings?
